1369:Memento Received: Precious Goblet
1370:Anyway... this tea delivery is far more than we bargained for.
1371:In the end, the only way Yuan Xiao and I can evade Chihori Terasaki's camera and questions is by climbing over the wall and into Bamboo Cloud's rear court.
1372:As soon as we land, we see Fei Ming sitting in the garden and holding a teapot. As if wholly unsurprised by our entrance, he continues pouring without missing a beat.
1373:Yuan Xiao, would you please check over the tea samples with me?
1374:{var:player_nickname}, you can stay here and entertain our guest.
1375:To break the silence, I pluck up the courage to ask him the question.
1376:Mr. Fei Ming, what tea did you give Ms. Minami that day?
1377:Without answering, he pours out the tea in front of me and fills it with boiled water. He then hands it back to me.
1378:Isn't this just... plain boiled water?
1379:He shakes his head, then pours boiled water into his own cup as well.
1380:If you think it's water, then it's water. If you think it's tea, then it's tea.
1381:You mean, tea is just a vibe?
1382:Heh, it's just a label for it, nothing more. What you see, think, and understand in the moment you're drinking it, as well as what you think it should be, all make it what it is.
1383:You'll have to ask her yourself. How would a bystander know what she glimpsed in her cup?
1384:Or...
1385:Fei Ming taps his cup with his finger and scans over me with his eyes.
1386:One day, when you earn the privilege of being an honored guest on Magical Dream's third floor... you'll understand.
1387:Magical Dream's third floor... I'm suddenly taken back to my conversation with Kutsuji earlier...
1388:Is Strix the only intelligence organization in One Han City?
1389:That depends on your definition. If trading in information is all it takes to be an intelligence organization, then... heh, Magical Dream counts as one too.
1390:Magical Dream?
1391:That tea house on Champion Street. They say the people that go to the third floor all come out in a daze, like empty shells of themselves. I bet they saw something their minds couldn't handle. But you wouldn't believe something like that, would you?
1392:Without saying another word, Fei Ming gets to his feet. He picks up an unused cup from the antique tea set and hands it to me.
1393:This tea set is from Magical Dream's collection, it's been around for quite some time now. Destiny brought you and the tea house together, and that's earned you this teacup. Until we meet again.
1394:Since you were destined to be brought together, its fate is in your hands now.
1395:What happened? Is there something wrong with the tea?
1396:No... there's something wrong with my boss! He brought the tea samples here himself, that's why he was already here!
1397:Your boss ordered a few boxes of the most expensive tea we have! So much for everything being above board while they gave us the runaround...
1398:Seeing how frustrated Yuan Xiao is, I hastily reach out and offer her a comforting pat on the shoulder.
1399:But Ms. Minami said that the cost of the damage to the tea bags will be deducted from your salary...
1400:Memento Received: Teacup From Fei Ming
